    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d265">

                <pb facs="0360" n="256" sameAs="frus:frus1932v05/pg256"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2591: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the Commission of Neutrals (White) to
                        the President of the Council of the League of Nations (De Valera)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-12-10">December 10,
                        1932</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Neutral Commission has received your telegram December 6th<anchor n="44"
                        xml:id="d265-f1"/> and much appreciation helpful attitude of Council.</p>
                <p>Neutral Commission pleased to note statement that Council will support in every
                    way efforts now being made by Commission to bring this unhappy dispute to
                    satisfactory close. Commission hopes shortly to be able to announce definite
                    progress or else definite programme for future action.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
